      "y": 0,
      "name": "CTA Behaviour Note",
      "width": 340,
      "height": 230,
      "content": "Hero CTAs — split buttons\n\nPrimary: label reflects the OS detected from the user agent (macOS shown). Chevron opens:\n· macOS · Apple silicon (.dmg)\n· macOS · Intel (.dmg)\n· Windows (.msi)\n· Linux (.AppImage)\n· Linux (.deb)\n\nSecondary: label reflects the detected browser. Chevron opens:\n· Chrome / Edge / Brave\n· Firefox\n\nFallback when detection fails: primary reads \"Download\" and opens the same menu."
